{title: Dil Lena Khel Hai Dildar Ka}
{artist: R D Burman}
{key: F#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[F#m]Dil lena khel hai dil [F#]dar ka,        [F#]Bhule se naam na lo pyar ka
Pyar bhi [Bm]rutha yaar bhi rutha,        [D]Dekho mujhako dilavalo ha
Khaya hai dhokha ho maine [F#m]yaar ka,        [C#]Waadon pe inake na jana
[C#]Baaton me inaki na [A]aana,        [C#]Are, vado pe inake na jana
[C#]Baato me inaki na [A]aana,        [B]Inaki mithi bate ye matavali aankhe
[Bm]zahar hai pyar [F#m]ka,        [F#m]Dil lena khel hai dil [F#]dar ka
[F#]Bhule se naam na lo pyar ka,        Pyar bhi [Bm]rutha yaar bhi rutha
[D]Dekho mujhako dilavalo ha,        Khaya hai dhokha ho maine [F#m]yaar ka
[C#]Inape zavani luta do,        [C#]yaa zindagani [A]luta do
[C#]Are, inape zavani lutaa do,        [C#]Yaa zindagani [A]lutaa do
[B]Are kuchh bhi kar divane,        [B]Rahenge ye anjane
[Bm]Rona hai bekar ka,        [F#m]Dil lena khel hai dil [F#]dar ka
[F#]Bhule se naam na lo pyar ka,        Pyar bhi [Bm]rutha yaar bhi rutha
[D]Dekho mujhako dilavalo ha,        Khaya hai dhokha ho maine [F#m]yaar ka
